### Buscar repositorios públicos de GitHub con Reactor.Maui y Syncfusion.Maui.Toolkit (por defecto)
POST https://localhost:7000/api/github/search-nuget-packages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "packages": ["Reactor.Maui", "Syncfusion.Maui.Toolkit"],
  "maxResults": 30
}

###

### Buscar con paquetes personalizados
POST https://localhost:7000/api/github/search-nuget-packages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "packages": ["Reactor.Maui", "Syncfusion.Maui.Toolkit"],
  "maxResults": 10
}
